Hi Avery,

Here's what shipped in Notion this month for your workspace:

- Custom agents can now run on a schedule. Set one to summarize a database every Monday at 8am and post the result to a page or a Slack channel.
- Database charts: bar, line and donut views straight from any database, no export.
- Meeting notes now attach to the calendar event they came from, and transcripts are searchable.
- Permissions audit: admins get a one-page view of who can see what, with one-click fixes.

Read the full release notes: https://mail.notion.so/c/feb-release-7q1n

Tip of the month: type /chart in any page to visualize a linked database inline.

Thanks for building with us,
The Notion Team

